[?2004l[?2004h>         "answer": "Important warnings and precautions associated with Paxlovid are: risk of serious, life-threatening, or fatal adverse reactions due to drug interactions (strong CYP3A inhibition by ritonavir, or loss of therapeutic effect and possible resistance due to CYP3A induction); hypersensitivity reactions (including anaphylaxis, toxic epidermal necrolysis, Stevens-Johnson syndrome; discontinue immediately if signs occur); hepatotoxicity (hepatic transaminase elevations, clinical hepatitis, jaundice; caution in pre-existing liver disease or liver enzyme abnormalities); and risk of HIV-1 resistance development in individuals with uncontrolled or undiagnosed HIV-1 infection.",
