      Quote: 'Lopinavir and ritonavir can be given in once daily or twice daily dosing regimen at dosages noted in Tables 1 and 2. Lopinavir and ritonavir once daily dosing regimen is not recommended in:'
    - PASSAGE_0004 (Recommended Dosage)
      Quote: '80 mg/20 mg per mL Oral Solution 800 mg/200 mg (10 mL) once daily'
    - PASSAGE_0005 (Recommended Dosage)
      Quote: '80 mg/20 mg per mL Oral Solution 400 mg/100 mg (5 mL)\xa0twice daily'
    - PASSAGE_0006 (Recommended Dosage)
